      "speakerId": "44bb4f52-930b-5cd4-be80-ddcdf2abc781",
      "content": "의외의 조언",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Unexpected advice",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0b7bfbcb-9d09-50db-a1f7-8a12c606bcaf",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 4,
      "x": 640,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "옆 팀 선수한테 들은 얘기가 있는데요…\n제 플레이에 딱 맞는 것 같아요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "I heard something from a player on another team…\nI think it fits my play perfectly.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "709bf54f-4597-5c25-963c-8fc9e11f9b46",
      "type": "Comment",
      "name": "Comment",
      "localId": 5,
      "x": 340,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "text": "사건 이벤트 설정",
      "width": 260,
      "height": 110,
      "attachments": [
        {
          "nodeId": "52f70c01-acd3-5327-a75c-55b122642269"
        }
      ],
      "sharedValues": {
        "555b99db-dbd1-56fd-b647-7246cba51651": "incident",
        "bd126cb3-186c-530b-8791-535efa66b21b": -1,
        "34454580-4603-5e9a-acac-a3541e678de1": 0,
        "e3b1ed52-d9f1-510e-b256-1b18cc7c944c": "",
        "e34da94e-1d5e-546a-b54f-122db16e81d1": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d9100b36-8abf-5d8b-83da-c36942a97abc",
      "type": "Select",
      "name": "Select",
      "localId": 6,
      "x": 940,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "b7d4a6dd-3cfc-5c04-9ba5-f9c22f3ceb19",
          "text": "흥미롭네. 같이 연구해 보자.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "c05cdf9f-010f-5049-a964-e0d0e99bb156": "ok>awaken:+12;ok>trust:+2;ng>pmod:all:-1:1"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "24d2ad5c-7150-5f4c-bbd5-182befeb150f",
          "text": "남의 말에 흔들리지 마.",
          "sharedValues": {
            "c05cdf9f-010f-5049-a964-e0d0e99bb156": "trust:+1"
          }
        }
      ],
      "translations": {
        "opt:b7d4a6dd-3cfc-5c04-9ba5-f9c22f3ceb19": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Interesting. Let's study it together.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        },
        "opt:24d2ad5c-7150-5f4c-bbd5-182befeb150f": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Don't let others' words shake you.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "14e364b4-3424-5e4e-bee8-845c267ed25f",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 7,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "역시 감독님이에요!",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "That's why you're the coach!",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "a47fcaaf-714f-560b-bcd6-cef3930256cd": "ok"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3c1965b9-7ac3-5072-9979-8d20af2025f9",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 8,
      "x": 1540,
      "y": -220,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "…생각보다 안 맞네요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "…It doesn't fit as well as I thought.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      },
      "sharedValues": {
        "a47fcaaf-714f-560b-bcd6-cef3930256cd": "ng"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e8d66c25-661c-5638-a1e7-d0316fa262a7",
      "type": "Dialog",
      "name": "Dialog",
      "localId": 9,
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 40,
      "color": "#64748b",
      "speakerId": "0a3f02b0-80bb-5e10-8f8d-897f9e479f2a",
      "content": "네… 그럴게요.",
      "statements": [],
      "childFlowId": null,
      "labelIds": [],
      "translations": {
        "content": {
          "1fc639b5-44de-55c2-9e8c-9a9a525ac8d4": {
            "text": "Okay… I will.",
            "status": "progress"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
